        "uniformity over pinnings",
        "source-specific local-to-global theorem",
        "mixing with its exact clock"
      ],
      "do_not_conflate": "One covariance matrix is not spectral independence; neither is Euclidean strong convexity or generating-polynomial log-concavity without a proved bridge."
